  "summary": "Serializes a complete vehicle setup configuration into a text file. Guards on (a3 or *this); initializes a small output struct with ZeroInitSmallStruct, opens the file via sub_566940(a2, 0, 0, 1), and on success writes a General header, multi-line setup notes (copied in 128-byte chunks from the notes pointer at this+0x68, defaulting to byte_5EA438), then labeled key-value blocks for symmetric/CG/wedge/tire/fuel/pitstops, fenders/wings, body aero, suspension, controls, engine, gear ratios, differential, per-wheel corner settings, and a basic setup section. Gear ratios are min-clamped in a 6-entry loop over this+0x1704 before the driveline section. On success it closes the file with ConditionalFileHandleCloseWithFlagDispatch, clears this[0], runs SubCallWithConditionalFieldFree cleanup and returns 0. On open failure it builds an error string with StringSplitLoop and logs it via DebugLogWrite, runs the same cleanup and returns -1.",
